atus. By evaluating these measurements, healthcare professionals can gain insights into a person's physical health and overall well-being.", "ECG:Electrocardiogram (ECG) is a test performed to monitor the patient's heart activity and detect any abnormalities.", "ANALÍTICA:ANALÍTICA refers to the laboratory tests conducted to evaluate a patient's biochemical markers and overall health status. These analytical tests are essential for monitoring various blood parameters, including blood counts, enzyme levels, blood sugar levels, and nutritional deficiencies. By assessing these factors, ANALÍTICA provides valuable insights into the patient's condition, helping healthcare professionals make informed decisions regarding diagnosis and treatment."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}